SUMMARY:TokenTotals Hermes: User-Zero Live Receipt Proof
DESCRIPTION:Run TokenTotals with the TurnReceipt Hermes plugin in normal Hermes. Launch gate is a normal Hermes prompt and answer followed directly by the matching Turn Receipt. Preserve any failure. Browser/frontier testing is not the launch gate. TokenTotals provides local turn receipts and cost pacing for AI agents. The local pacing threshold is local admission control, not provider-account clearance; permitted remote-provider requests still egress upstream.
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
